为那样的痛苦不值得来打扰王”或译“但王的损失，敌人无法补偿”。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EST/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EST/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EST/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}